      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(slack): bound userCache growth with pruneMapToMaxSize",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`userCache` in Slack monitor context stores resolved user names from successful `users.info` calls but had no pruning — every unique user ID accumulated forever. `channelCache` already bounds at 1024 via `pruneMapToMaxSize`.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nMirror the current-main `channelCache` pattern for users: LRU touch on read, `pruneMapToMaxSize` on write, cap `SLACK_USER_CACHE_MAX_ENTRIES = 2048`, using `openclaw/plugin-sdk/collection-runtime`.\n\n## User Impact\n\n- Long-running Slack monitors no longer retain unbounded user-name cache entries.\n- Active users stay resident (LRU touch); oldest entries evict first after the cap.\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Head SHA:** `45d874411d946d54bab55c63047ab7382a8359ae` (rebased onto current `main`)\n\n### Rank-up coverage\n\n| Rank-up | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Rebase onto current main | done |\n| Supported `pruneMapToMaxSize` (same as channelCache) | done |\n| Eviction + LRU-recency unit coverage | done |\n| Redacted **successful** `users.info` + bounded-cache runtime evidence | done (transcript below) |\n| Rotate previously exposed credentials | caller re-issued tokens for this proof; **rotate again after paste into chat** |\n\n### L1 unit\n\n- `evicts the oldest user name when the bounded user cache fills` (2050 `users.info` calls after refill)\n- `keeps a recently re-resolved user while older entries are evicted` (LRU touch)\n\n### L3 live Slack API + cache path (redacted) — 2026-07-13\n\nUsed rotated Bot (`xoxb-…`) and User (`xoxp-…`) tokens from local env only (not committed). **Rotate again — they were pasted into chat.**\n\n```text\n# Slack userCache live proof — PR #105978\nTime (UTC): 2026-07-13T16:09:51.034029+00:00\nTokens never printed; kind + last-6 only. IDs/names redacted.\nNote: caller labels were swapped; tokens used by prefix (xoxb=bot, xoxp=user).\n\n========================================================================\nCALL: auth.test bot\nAPI POST https://slack.com/api/auth.test\ntoken xoxb-…109Tev  http=200  latency=2154ms\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"user_id\": \"U0B…REDACTED\",\n  \"bot_id\": \"B0B…REDACTED\",\n  \"team_id\": \"T0B…REDACTED\",\n  \"is_enterprise_install\": false\n}\n\n========================================================================\nCALL: auth.test user\nAPI POST https://slack.com/api/auth.test\ntoken xoxp-…b4311c  http=200  latency=885ms\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"user_id\": \"U0B…REDACTED\",\n  \"bot_id\": null,\n  \"team_id\": \"T0B…REDACTED\",\n  \"is_enterprise_install\": false\n}\n\n========================================================================\nCALL: users.info bot->bot_user\nAPI POST https://slack.com/api/users.info\ntoken xoxb-…109Tev  http=200  latency=901ms\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"needed\": null,\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"U…REDACTED\",\n    \"is_bot\": true,\n    \"name_set\": true,\n    \"profile_display_name_set\": false,\n    \"profile_real_name_set\": true\n  }\n}\n\n========================================================================\nCALL: users.info bot->human_user\nAPI POST https://slack.com/api/users.info\ntoken xoxb-…109Tev  http=200  latency=876ms\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"needed\": null,\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"U…REDACTED\",\n    \"is_bot\": false,\n    \"name_set\": true,\n    \"profile_display_name_set\": false,\n    \"profile_real_name_set\": true\n  }\n}\n\n========================================================================\nCALL: users.info user->self\nAPI POST https://slack.com/api/users.info\ntoken xoxp-…b4311c  http=200  latency=1049ms\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"needed\": null,\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"U…REDACTED\",\n    \"is_bot\": false,\n    \"name_set\": true,\n    \"profile_display_name_set\": false,\n    \"profile_real_name_set\": true\n  }\n}\n\n========================================================================\nCALL: conversations.members bot public\nAPI POST https://slack.com/api/conversations.members\ntoken xoxb-…109Tev  http=200  latency=897ms\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"member_count\": 1\n}\n\n========================================================================\nCALL: conversations.members user private\nAPI POST https://slack.com/api/conversations.members\ntoken xoxp-…b4311c  http=200  latency=1054ms\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"member_count\": 1\n}\n\n========================================================================\nRUNTIME PATH: resolveUserName-equivalent (live users.info + writeCachedUser/prune)\n========================================================================\nunique_users_resolved=2\nlive_users.info_calls_first_pass=2\nlive_users.info_calls_after_second_pass=2 (delta=0, expect 0)\ncache_size_after_live_resolve=2\nfirst_pass=[\n  {\n    \"user\": \"U\\u2026REDACTED\",\n    \"cache\": \"miss\",\n    \"name_set\": true,\n    \"error\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"user\": \"U\\u2026REDACTED\",\n    \"cache\": \"miss\",\n    \"name_set\": true,\n    \"error\": null\n  }\n]\nsecond_pass_kinds=[\"hit\", \"hit\"]\n\nBOUNDED EVICTION after live seed (pruneMapToMaxSize semantics, cap=2048):\nafter 3000 synthetic writes on top of 2 live users → size=2048\nsize==2048: True\nlive_keys_remaining=0 (expect 0)\nre_resolve_evicted_live_user: cache=miss users.info_delta=1 (expect miss+1)\nSUCCESS: live users.info populated cache; bound eviction forced re-fetch.\n\nBEFORE (main): userCache.set unbounded.\nAFTER (PR): readCachedUser LRU touch + writeCachedUser + pruneMapToMaxSize(2048).\n```\n\n### Before / after\n\n| Step | BEFORE (main) | AFTER (this PR) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Successful `users.info` | `userCache.set` forever | `writeCachedUser` + prune at 2048 |\n| Cache hit | plain `Map.get` | `readCachedUser` LRU touch |\n| After eviction flood | N/A | live user re-resolve → miss + fresh `users.info` |\n\n### Files\n\n- `extensions/slack/src/monitor/context.ts`\n- `extensions/slack/src/monitor/context.test.ts`\n\n## Agent Transcript\n\n- Cursor session: Slack #105978 successful users.info + bounded cache proof (tokens redacted; rotate if exposed).\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n",
